────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Sandbox

    Mode:    contained

    Allowed: read-only ops + write_file & edit_file (with confirmation), run_command (with confirmation)
    Blocked: apply_patch without confirmation, raw shell beyond cwd

    Set via:     --permission-mode <auto|approve|skip> at startup
                 or --no-sandbox to disable OS-level sandbox
    Enforced by: agiworkforce-sandbox-policy (macOS Seatbelt / bwrap)

  Esc to close
